{"schema_version":"1.1","definitions":{"definition-1":"WHAT THE GATEWAY ADDS, at concurrency 1. The gateway leg's percentile minus the same request taken straight to the mock, one at a time, both legs in the same window. No search and no threshold: there is nothing to stop early and nothing to decide. A difference at or below what the rig can resolve publishes `below_resolution` - the best result the comparison can express - and every surface renders that apart from a never-measured hole.","definition-2":"WHAT THE GATEWAY ADDS TO A STREAM, at concurrency 1: time to the first event, and the gaps between frames inside one stream, each as the gateway leg minus the same stream taken straight to the mock. Time-to-first-EVENT rather than first token, deliberately and by the same definition on both legs: a frame budget of one is satisfied by a dialect's opening scaffolding (openai sends a role delta, anthropic a `message_start`), so the quantity is the same on both sides and the difference still isolates what the gateway added."},"dataset_id":"dataset-0e94f34b177392a78b5a0a0de8d5f4eca433b24af2f2081064af48974f5ef5b8","generated_at":"2026-11-08T19:07:23.959Z","published_at":"2026-11-08T19:07:23.620Z","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","selected_protocol_pair":{"ingress_protocol":"openai","upstream_protocol":"openai"},"results":[{"gateway_id":"agentgateway","name":"agentgateway","gateway_build":"ghcr.io/agentgateway/agentgateway:v1.4.1","measured_at":"2026-08-26T19:08:42Z","published_at":"2026-11-08T19:07:23.620Z","generated_at":"2026-11-08T19:07:23.959Z","age_days":73,"age_as_of":"2026-11-08T19:07:23.959Z","age":"73 days old at collection generation","current_metadata":{"stars":6036,"stars_as_of":"2026-11-08","first_commit":"2025-03-18"},"status":{"state":"served","raw_state":true,"reason":null,"detail":null,"evidence_scope":"Recorded run evidence","probe_http_status":null,"response_excerpt":null},"metrics":{"added_latency_p50_us":{"value":195,"certifie